WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.682
Lab 2 runs the pipeline for real, in
a test tenant and a test subscription,

2
00:00:04.682 --> 00:00:07.900
never production, from a
private test repository

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.962
that holds the validation
kit and this example.

4
00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:15.780
Register an app that trusts the repository
through a federated credential,

5
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.838
so no secret is stored, and
grant it only the reads.

6
00:00:18.838 --> 00:00:22.508
Make an evidence container with
an unlocked retention policy,

7
00:00:22.508 --> 00:00:24.837
and set up the repository's environment.

8
00:00:24.837 --> 00:00:29.837
Run the workflow by hand for a baseline,
make one real change, and run it again.

9
00:00:29.837 --> 00:00:31.375
Then let the schedule run.

10
00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:35.687
To back it out, step eight deletes
the federated credential and the app.

11
00:00:35.687 --> 00:00:40.690
Leave the test retention policy unlocked:
Microsoft Learn's page on immutable

12
00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.692
storage says an unlocked policy
is only for short-term testing,

13
00:00:44.692 --> 00:00:46.000
and it can be deleted.

14
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.150
The authors haven't run Lab 2.

15
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:51.600
Follow Chapter 09's Lab 2, step by step.
